# Pristine lesson files are the reset point a Solution is copied from — they are
# never edited, so Prettier must never rewrite them either. A format-on-save in
# an open exercise.test.js once produced a 200-line whitespace-only diff.
#
# This lives at the repo root on purpose: Prettier reads .prettierignore only
# from the directory it is RUN from, and never walks up from the file being
# formatted the way it does for .prettierrc. Since the editor's workspace root
# is this directory, this is the only place the ignore is actually honoured.
**/exercise.js
**/exercise.ts
**/exercise.test.js
**/exercise.test.ts
**/fixtures/**

# Generated / vendored
node_modules/
mastering-java/lib/
mastering-java/.build/
.tsconfig.scope.json
